{"source": "app_details", "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails?appids=1366800&cc=us&l=english", "collected_at": "2026-10-13T22:47:59Z", "http_status": 200, "payload": {"1366800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crosshair X", "steam_appid": 1366800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366800/extras/8a0b4808e8aa3b16beb892f7b56326e7.poster.avif?t=1783870581\" width=1000 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366800/extras/8a0b4808e8aa3b16beb892f7b56326e7.webm?t=1783870581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366800/extras/8a0b4808e8aa3b16beb892f7b56326e7.mp4?t=1783870581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A custom crosshair for every game you play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crosshair X overlays your own custom crosshair on top of any game you play, even games that do not include one. Improve your aim and accuracy in first-person shooters, third-person shooters, battle royales, survival games, and anything else you play on PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rated <strong>Very Positive</strong> with over 41,000 reviews on Steam, Crosshair X is the most popular crosshair overlay on PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thousands of community designs.</strong> Browse and download crosshairs shared by the Crosshair X community, with new designs added every day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision designer.</strong> Build your own crosshair from scratch with controls for lines, dot, outline, color, opacity, and animations. Upload any image to use as your crosshair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Works in every game.</strong> Compatible with first-person shooters, third-person games, survival titles, and single-player adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exclusive fullscreen support.</strong> Show your crosshair even in games that block third-party overlays, through the official Xbox Game Bar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Workshop.</strong> Subscribe to crosshairs from the Steam Workshop and publish your own designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-monitor support.</strong> Choose which monitor to display the crosshair on, and save the crosshair position for each game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save and switch.</strong> Save unlimited crosshairs and switch between them in seconds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart toggle.</strong> Show or hide your crosshair with a custom keyboard shortcut, or hide it automatically when you right-click to aim down sights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share with friends.</strong> Share any crosshair with a single code, or export it as an image file.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Available in 17 languages.</strong> English, Spanish, French, German, Italian, Portuguese, Russian, Japanese, Korean, Chinese, Turkish, Polish, Swedish, Czech, Danish, and Ukrainian.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Videos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366800/extras/3e3a63b9c21be6c2b0806a85c0ac3302.poster.avif?t=1783870581\" width=1000 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366800/extras/3e3a63b9c21be6c2b0806a85c0ac3302.webm?t=1783870581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat