l class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thousands of community designs.</strong> Browse and download crosshairs shared by the Crosshair X community, with new designs added every day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision designer.</strong> Build your own crosshair from scratch with controls for lines, dot, outline, color, opacity, and animations. Upload any image to use as your crosshair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Works in every game.</strong> Compatible with first-person shooters, third-person games, survival titles, and single-player adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exclusive fullscreen support.</strong> Show your crosshair even in games that block third-party overlays, through the official Xbox Game Bar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Workshop.</strong> Subscribe to crosshairs from the Steam Workshop and publish your own designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-monitor support.</strong> Choose which monitor to display the crosshair on, and save the crosshair position for each game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save and switch.</strong> Save unlimited crosshairs and switch between them in seconds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart toggle.</strong> Show or hide your crosshair with a custom keyboard shortcut, or hide it automatically when you right-click to aim down sights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share with friends.</strong> Share any crosshair with a single code, or export it as an image file.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Available in 17 languages.</strong> English, Spanish, French, German, Italian, Portuguese, Russian, Japanese, Korean, Chinese, Turkish, Polish, Swedish, Czech, Danish, and Ukrainian.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Videos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted